        "description": "Elayne is a premium full-site-editing block theme for professional websites. Launch a fast, pixel-perfect site with 140+ conversion-optimized block patterns — including ready-to-insert page patterns that assemble a full page in one paste — 8 style variations, and industry-specific pattern sets for spa and wellness, legal, food and beverage, home services, nail salon, and publishing. Fully customizable with Global Styles — no page builder required. ✶ Full demo: https://demo.imagewize.com ✶"
